arbor.webp","aspectRatio",1.75,"mobile","previewSrc","Preview description","Official Code World Model recording of a wind-skiff moving through a painted cloud-sea harbor, with WASD and action controls visible","alt","Recording type","Original project recording","role","provenance","Track","World models","track","metadata","Related project",[91],"resourceId",{"_49":92,"_26":93},"Code World Model: Coding Agent as World Brain","/resources/code-world-model-brain/","What this recording shows","Recorded research output: program state drives a proxy-conditioned video renderer. This preview is a video, not an interactive browser game. The public release omits the closed-source game foundation and proxy-generation tools.","limitations","Demo category","World model","demoType","lead","world","world-model","source-recording","recordingId","code-world-model-brain","resource:code-world-model-brain","resource","A coding agent writes executable rules and persistent state to drive a video world.","/resources/",{"_20":105,"_184":92,"_182":101,"_47":185,"_183":108,"_178":177,"_26":175,"_57":186,"_155":187,"_150":188,"_146":189,"_140":190,"_137":136},[113,114,115,116,117,118,119,120,121,122,123,124,125,126],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_47":22,"_51":92,"_53":184,"_55":-7},{"_47":100,"_51":108,"_53":183,"_55":-7},{"_47":48,"_49":181,"_51":85,"_53":182,"_55":87},{"_47":48,"_49":179,"_51":180,"_53":47,"_55":87},{"_47":48,"_49":176,"_51":177,"_53":178,"_55":56},{"_47":57,"_49":172,"_59":173,"_53":26,"_55":-7},{"_47":57,"_49":162,"_59":163,"_53":57,"_55":-7},{"_47":141,"_49":153,"_143":144,"_59":154,"_53":155,"_55":-7},{"_47":141,"_49":148,"_143":144,"_59":149,"_53":150,"_55":-7},{"_47":141,"_49":142,"_143":144,"_59":145,"_53":146,"_55":-7},{"_47":48,"_49":138,"_51":139,"_53":140,"_55":87},{"_47":48,"_49":135,"_51":136,"_53":137,"_55":87},{"_47":48,"_53":132,"_49":133,"_51":134},{"_47":57,"_53":127,"_49":128,"_59":129},"identitySource","Identity evidence",[130],{"_49":131,"_26":63},"Westlake University","identity","Identity & attribution","The author project page lists AGI Lab, Westlake University as affiliation 1 and Nanyang Technological University as affiliation 2. First author Yiwen Chen has both affiliations. Select the first listed institution. The logo URL is declared as Organization.logo in the official English university homepage JSON-LD.","Source reviewed","2026-10-18","verified","Year","2026","year","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[147,85],"dimensions","3D","Development stages",[151,152,85],"stages","Planning","Gameplay & code","Topics",[156,157,158,159,160,161],"tags","code-world-model","coding-agent","executable-state","hybrid-renderer","MiniMax-H3","partial-release","Further reading",[164,165,166],{"_49":171,"_26":63},{"_49":169,"_26":170},{"_49":167,"_26":168},"Reproduction scope","https://github.com/buaacyw/code-world-model/blob/main/ENVIRONMENT.md","Inference code","https://github.com/buaacyw/code-world-model","Project","Project source",[174],{"_49":172,"_26":175},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.25927","Why it belongs here","Separates world evolution from visual generation. An agent maintains executable state, which is compiled into controls for a fine-tuned MiniMax-H3 renderer. The released inference interface uses an RGB first-frame anchor, per-frame depth and semantic-ID controls, and per-window prompts. Inference code, LoRAs, and examples are public, but the underlying game code that generates proxies cannot be redistributed. The complete agent-to-engine pipeline cannot be reproduced unchanged from those artifacts.","detail","Resource type","Paper","Category","category","summary","name","paper",[194,195,196],[156,157,158,159,160,161],[192,193,101],[191,101],2026,"3d","plan","code",{"_49":171,"_26":63},{"_49":169,"_26":170},{"_49":167,"_26":168},{"_198":199},"documents",{"_200":201,"_202":203},"en",[205,209,210,211,208,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,23